    road 3: 0.5–0.99 3269, 0.99–1.1 734, 1.1–1.5 2669, 1.5–1.9 2669, 1.9–2.1 1334, 2.1–2.5 2669: 13344 s,
            4.448 h of travel; the spur 0.05° (5.56 km): 334 s.
